Z||000000||87FieroGT||10-02-2000||11:26 AM||||What is the best and easiest way to pull a manual transmission from my Fiero?  The trans is a 5 speed Muncie and I will be replacing it with a 5 speed Isuzu.  If holding up the engine and dropping the cradle is the best way that is what I will go with.  I just wanted to check to hear from those that may have done this before.||||reg||1
