Z||000006||PJ||10-02-2000||10:11 PM||||The Getrag is built like a tank and bullet-proof if maintained and not abused. It is also simple to rebuild when the bearings start to go and bearings are cheap. Tricky part is getting the proper preload on the carrier bearings. I think me and Rodney are the only ones who know how. I've yet to find a dealer with the special tool (not really needed) or a tech who knows what its for.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>PJ<BR>ITA #66 Black<BR> ||||reg||1
Z||000007||Cooter||10-02-2000||10:33 PM||||The tranny has 175,000 on it and I never really drove the car before swapping in the 3.4/4 speed. All I know is that it grinds going into 3rd. Includes the slave, good clutch and pressure plate. The tranny may/may not be rebuildable. $50+ shipping?||||reg||1
